* ======================================================================
* Model: Laser Diode
* Description: Realistic laser diode model with series resistance
*              and junction capacitance.
* Pins: A (Anode), K (Cathode)
* ======================================================================
.SUBCKT LaserDiode A K

* Internal node for series resistance
* Note: N1 is internal - add to port list for standard SPICE compatibility
D1 A N1 DLD
Rs N1 K 2

.MODEL DLD D (
+ IS=1e-20
+ N=1.8
+ RS=0
+ BV=5
+ IBV=1u
+ CJO=50p
+ VJ=1.5
+ M=0.5
+ TT=1n)

.ENDS LaserDiode

* =======================================================================
* Model: Photo Diode
* Description: Photodiode model with photocurrent source,
*              series resistance, shunt resistance, and junction capacitance.
* Pins: A (Anode), K (Cathode)
* Note: Photocurrent flows from K to A (reverse direction) when illuminated.
*       Default Iph=10uA can be overridden during instantiation.
* =======================================================================
.SUBCKT PhotoDiode A K PARAMS: Iph=10u

Rs A N1 5
D1 N1 N2 PD
Cj N2 K 10p
Rsh N2 K 100Meg

* Photocurrent source (direction: K to N2 = reverse bias current)
Ilight K N2 DC {Iph}

.MODEL PD D(
+ IS=1e-14
+ N=1.10
+ RS=0
+ CJO=10p
+ VJ=0.7
+ M=0.5
+ TT=5n
+ BV=60
+ IBV=1u)

.ENDS PhotoDiode

* =======================================================================
* Model: LED (Light Emitting Diode)
* Description: Practical LED model with series resistance.
* Pins: A (Anode), K (Cathode)
* =======================================================================
.SUBCKT LED A K

D1 A N1 LED_MODEL
Rs N1 K 5

.MODEL LED_MODEL D(
+ IS=1e-20
+ N=2
+ RS=0
+ CJO=30p
+ VJ=2.0
+ M=0.5
+ TT=10n
+ BV=5
+ IBV=100u)

.ENDS LED

* =======================================================================
* Model: OptoCoupler (Opto-Isolator)
* Description: LED + Phototransistor optocoupler with
*              Current Transfer Ratio (CTR) control.
* Pins: A (LED Anode), K (LED Cathode), 
*       C (Phototransistor Collector), E (Phototransistor Emitter)
*       B (Internal base node - use dummy net in instantiation)
* Note: CTR = Ic/Iled (typical values: 0.1 to 1.0)
* =======================================================================
.SUBCKT OptoCoupler A K C E B PARAMS: CTR=0.5

* LED with series resistance
DLED A N1 LED_MODEL
RLED N1 K 2

.MODEL LED_MODEL D(
+ IS=1e-20
+ N=2
+ RS=2
+ CJO=20p
+ VJ=1.5
+ M=0.5)

* Zero-volt voltage source to sense LED current
VSENSE N1 K 0

* Current-controlled current source for phototransistor base drive
FBASE B E VSENSE {CTR}

* Phototransistor
Q1 C B E PHOTO

.MODEL PHOTO NPN(
+ IS=1e-15
+ BF=100
+ VAF=100
+ CJE=10p
+ CJC=5p
+ TF=2n
+ TR=20n
+ BV=30)

* Base-emitter resistor for stability
RB B E 100k

.ENDS OptoCoupler

